    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha sha būlī lūshikū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Binhage a Baisilaeli ī shilagīlo īshi; ūbawīle gīkī, ‘Ī shilīwa sha kūnenhela nene kwiza kūshifunya mu nzīla ya kūshipemba mu moto, gīkī shibize sha kwenha ng'waso gwawiza kūlī nene, ng'ūshifunya ng'wikanza īlo līhelilwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage gīkī, ‘Ī shitambò īsho shiigeleelilwe kūmfunīja SEEBA mu nzīla ya kūshipemba mu moto shiishi, būlī lūshikū jikūfunyiwa ng'holo ibīlī, kūbiza shitambò sha kūpemva; būlī yene ībize ya ng'waka gūmò, na ītī na shilingo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īmò yajo īkūfunyiwa dilū, ī yīngī mhīndī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī yene īkūfunyiwa hamò na shakwinha sha būsu; kilo īmò ya būsu būnogu būsangije maguta, na liita īmò ya maguta gawiza ga kūkang'wa kūfuma mu zeituni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shenīshi h'ī shitambò sha kūpemva mu moto, īsho shikalagīlwa aho balī kū lūgūlū lwa Sinai, gīkī shikūyūpemva mu moto būlī lūshikū, shibize sha kwenha ng'waso gwawiza kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha sha kūng'wiwa īsho shikūja hamò nī shitambò shenīshi, shikūbiza liita īmò ya divai, kū būlī ng'holo īyo īlafunyiwe. Ī shakwinha sha kūng'wiwa shenīsho shikwitwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, a hipandī ī lyeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'holo ya kabīlī īkūbiza ya kūfunyiwa mhīndī, nayo īkūfunyiwa hamò na shakwinha sha būsu, na shakwinha sha kūng'wiwa, gīt'ūmo ūlīītīle ī dilū. Ī shitambò shenīshi shilī sha kūfunyiwa mu nzīla ya kūpemva mu moto, shūbiza shitambò sha kwenha ng'waso gwawiza kūlī SEEBA.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shitambo ha sabato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa Sabato ī shitambò shing'we shikūbiza ng'holo ibīlī, būlī yene ya ng'waka gūmò, na ītī na shilingo; hamò nī shakwinha sha kūng'wiwa nī sha būsu, kilo ibīlī ja būsu būnogu būsangije maguta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shenīshi h'ī shitambò sha kūpemva sha kūfunyiwa būlī lūshikū lwa Sabato; alīyo shikūīlanīja nī shitambò sha kūpemva īsho shikafunyiagwa būlī lūshikū, hamò nī shakwinha shaho ī sha kūng'wiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shitambo sha būlī ng'weji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na būlī ng'weji ūlū gūlandya, mukūmfunīja ū SEEBA shitambò sha kūpemva, nzagamba ibīlī songi, ng'ondi īmò, na ng'ondi mpungatī jitī na shilingo, būlī yene ībize ya ng'waka gūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī nzagamba īyo īlīfunyiwa ībize na shakwinha sha būsu sha kūja nayo, kilo idatū ja būsu būnogu būsangije amaguta; ī ng'ondi ībize hamò na shakwinha sha būsu; kilo ibīlī ja būsu būnogu būsangije maguta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ondi ī songi jibize na shakwinha sha būsu; kilo īmò ya būsu būnogu būsangije maguta. Ī shenīshi shikūfunyiwa mu nzīla ya kūpemva mu moto shūbiza sha kwenha ng'waso gwawiza kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī nzagamba īkūbiza na shakwinha sha kūng'wiwa, liita ibīlī ja divai; ī ng'ondi ī yene īkūbiza na liita īmò na lobo ya divai; alīyo ī ng'ondi ī songi ī jene būlī yene īkūbiza na liita īmò ya divai. Ī shitambò shenīshi shikūyūfunyiwa būlī ng'weji ū mu myeji ya ng'waka ngima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ngulyati ya mbūli īkūfunyiwa ībize shitambò sha būkenaagūji, īkūfunyiwa hamò nī shitambò sha kūpemva īsho shikafunyiagwa būlī lūshikū, nī shakwinha shaho ī sha kūng'wiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigukulu sha Pasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'inè ng'weji gwa kwandya, īkūbiza ho pasaka ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'itanò lūkūbiza lwa kwandya shigukulu; kwandīja lūshikū lwenūlo mukūlya migatī ītī na shibimbya, ikanza lya shikū mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa kwandya lwenūlo bizagi na kwibilinga kwela, nī milimo ī ya shikū jose yaya ū kwīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA mfunījagi shitambò sha kūpemva mu moto, nzagamba songi ibīlī, ng'ondi īmò na ng'ondi songi mpungatī jitī na shilingo; būlī yene ya ng'waka gūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūlīyīfunya ī nzagamba, būlī yene īfunyiwe hamò na shakwinha sha būsu, kilo idatū ja būsu būnogu būsangije maguta; ī ng'ondi ībize na kilo ibīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ondi ī songi būlī yene kilo īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūfunya na ngulyati īmò ya mbūli, ībize shitambò sha būkenaagūji, kūbeeja isangī kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shitambò shenīshi shikūfunyiwa hamò nī shitambò sha kūpemva īsho shikafunyiagwa būlī lūshikū dilū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwīta gīko nū kū shilīwa īsho shikapembagwa mu moto, shabiza sha kwenha ng'waso gwawiza kūlī SEEBA; nasho mukūshifunya būlī lūshikū, kūshisha ikanza lya shikū mpungatī. Ī shenīshi nasho shikūfunyiwa hamò nī shitambò sha kūpemva īsho shikafunyiagwa būlī lūshikū, nī shakwinha shaho ī sha kūng'wiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma a ha lūshikū lwa mpungatī mukūbiza na kwibilinga kwela; a henaho yaya hangī ū kwīta ī milīmo ying'we īyo mukīītaga na kale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigukulu sha mifungo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
