          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa kwenha matwajo ga kwandya, ūlū mulīmfunīja ū SEEBA ī shakwinha sha shilīwa shipya, ū mu shikū ja shigukulu sha mifungo, bizagi na kwibilinga kwela, na yaya ū kwīta ī milīmo yaho na kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūfunya nzagamba ibīlī songi, ng'ondī īmò na ng'ondi songi mpungatī, ja ng'waka gūmò būlī yene; jikūbiza shitambò sha kūpemva, sha kwenha ng'waso gwawiza kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū mulīfunya ī nzagamba, būlī yene īfunyiwe hamò na shakwinha sha būsu, kilo idatū ja būsu būnogu būsangije maguta; ī ng'ondi kilo ibīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ondi ī songi būlī yene kilo īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mbūli īmò ngulyati, mukwīfunya ībize shitambò sha būkenaagūji, kūbeeja isangī kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shitambò shenīshi shikūfunyiwa hamò nī shitambò sha kūng'wiwa īsho shikafunyiagwa hamò nasho; hama shikūfunyiwa hamò nī shitambò sha kūpemva īsho shikafunyiagwa būlī lūshikū, nī shakwinha shaho ī sha būsu. Pyī ī mitugo jenījo jibize jitī na shilingo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
